const escapeHTML = (value) => String(value ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, char => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[char]));
const catalog = {
  rack: {name:'M1 PRO 多功能训练架', short:'M1 PRO 训练架', price:999, image:'rack.svg'},
  bench: {name:'可调节力量训练凳', short:'可调节训练凳', price:249, image:'bench.svg'},
  plates: {name:'奥林匹克杠铃片套装', short:'杠铃片套装', price:129, image:'plates.svg'},
  mat: {name:'高密度健身地垫', short:'健身地垫', price:79, image:'mat.svg'},
};
const ui = new Map();
const defaults = () => [
  {id:'home-strength',name:'家庭力量训练套装',label:'最受欢迎',products:['rack','bench','plates'],discount:10,enabled:true,type:'manual',views:1248,orders:86},
  {id:'rack-essentials',name:'训练架必备配件',label:'高转化',products:['rack','plates','mat'],discount:15,enabled:true,type:'manual',views:826,orders:54},
  {id:'bench-training',name:'入门力量组合',label:'新组合',products:['bench','plates','mat'],discount:10,enabled:false,type:'manual',views:324,orders:12},
  {id:'co-purchase',name:'常一起购买的训练装备',label:'自动推荐',products:['rack','bench','mat'],discount:10,enabled:true,type:'auto',views:2156,orders:118},
  {id:'global-accessories',name:'每个家庭健身房都需要',label:'全局推荐',products:['plates','mat'],discount:10,enabled:true,type:'global',views:684,orders:38},
];
const storeKey = ctx => `commerce-bundles-${ctx.store}`;
const storefrontBundleKey = ctx => `commerce-storefront-bundle-${ctx.store}`;
function storefrontConfig(ctx) {
  const list=items(ctx), id=ctx.read(storefrontBundleKey(ctx),'home-strength');
  return list.find(bundle=>bundle.id===id)||list.find(bundle=>bundle.id==='home-strength')||list[0];
}
function selectStorefrontBundle(ctx,id) {ctx.persist(storefrontBundleKey(ctx),id);}
function offerSummary(ctx,ids) {
  const bundle=storefrontConfig(ctx),original=ids.reduce((sum,id)=>sum+(catalog[id]?.price||0),0);
  const counts=ids.reduce((all,id)=>(all[id]=(all[id]||0)+1,all),{});
  const sets=bundle.enabled?Math.min(...bundle.products.map(id=>counts[id]||0)):0;
  const discount=sets?Math.round(total(bundle)*sets*Number(bundle.discount))/100:0;
  return {bundle,original,discount,total:original-discount,eligible:sets>0};
}
function state(ctx) {
  const key=ctx.store;
  if(!ui.has(key)) ui.set(key,{tab:'manual',selected:'home-strength',query:'',dirty:false,mobile:false});
  return ui.get(key);
}
function items(ctx) {return ctx.read(storeKey(ctx),defaults());}
function save(ctx,list) {ctx.persist(storeKey(ctx),list);}
function redraw(ctx) {const node=document.querySelector('.bundle-page'); if(node){node.outerHTML=renderBundles(ctx);bindBundles(ctx);}}
function productImage(id,cls='') {const product=catalog[id];return `<img class="${cls}" src="./assets/${product.image}" alt="${product.name}" loading="lazy">`;}
const total = bundle => bundle.products.reduce((sum,id)=>sum+catalog[id].price,0);

const styles = `<style>
.bundle-page{--bundle-green:#147d60}.bundle-title,.storefront-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:26px}.bundle-title h1,.storefront-title h1{font-size:27px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:0 0 9px}.bundle-title p,.storefront-title p{color:var(--muted,#747982);font-size:14px;margin:0}.bundle-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-bottom:24px}.bundle-stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e8eb;border-radius:12px;padding:22px}.bundle-stat-label{font-size:14px;color:#6f747d;margin-bottom:13px}.bundle-stat strong{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.7px;font-weight:650}.bundle-stat small{color:#178461;font-size:12px;margin-left:10px}.bundle-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.25fr) minmax(310px,.85fr);gap:22px;align-items:start}.bundle-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin:0 0 18px}.bundle-search{position:relative;max-width:260px;flex:1}.bundle-search svg{position:absolute;left:12px;top:11px;color:#8a8e94}.bundle-search input{width:100%;height:40px;border:1px solid #e0e4e8;border-radius:8px;background:white;padding:0 12px 0 37px;font:inherit;font-size:13px}.bundle-list{display:grid;gap:13px}.bundle-choice{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:19px;cursor:pointer;color:inherit;font:inherit;transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}.bundle-choice:hover{border-color:#a5bdb4}.bundle-choice.is-selected{border:1.5px solid #228568;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #22856809;padding:18.5px}.bundle-choice-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}.bundle-choice-head strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.bundle-choice-sub{font-size:12px;color:#8a9098;margin-top:7px}.bundle-products{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.bundle-product-thumb{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:8px;background:#f5f6f7;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid #edf0f2}.bundle-plus{color:#9da2a8;font-size:18px}.bundle-choice-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #f0f1f3;padding-top:13px;font-size:12px;color:#7e848d}.bundle-choice-foot b{color:#377a66;font-weight:500}.bundle-discount-pill{font-size:11px;background:#edf6f1;color:#197653;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px}.bundle-preview{background:white;border:1px solid #e2e6ea;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.bundle-preview-head{padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #eceff1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.bundle-preview-caption{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:#828891}.bundle-preview-shop{padding:23px}.bundle-preview-shop small{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;color:#7c838b}.bundle-preview-hero{margin:14px 0;background:#f5f6f7;border-radius:9px;height:190px;display:grid;place-items:center}.bundle-preview-hero img{height:175px;max-width:90%;object-fit:contain}.bundle-preview-shop h3{font-size:17px;margin:8px 0}.bundle-preview-price{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.bundle-preview-rating{font-size:11px;color:#939aa1;margin:9px 0 19px}.bundle-preview-rating span{color:#e3a746;letter-spacing:2px;margin-right:8px}.bundle-widget{border:1px solid #e5e9e7;border-radius:8px;padding:15px;margin-top:18px}.bundle-widget h4{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 13px}.bundle-widget-images{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px}.bundle-widget-images img{width:62px;height:62px;object-fit:contain;background:#f7f8f8;border-radius:5px}.bundle-widget-total{font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:15px}.bundle-widget-total s{color:#959ba2;font-size:11px;margin-right:6px}.bundle-widget-total b{color:#16795c}.bundle-widget-button{border:0;background:#193e32;color:white;border-radius:6px;width:100%;font-size:12px;padding:10px;margin-top:12px;cursor:pointer}.bundle-settings{padding:18px 20px;background:#fbfcfc;border-top:1px solid #e9edeb}.bundle-setting-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;gap:12px}.bundle-setting-row label{color:#606b72}.bundle-setting-row select{border:1px solid #dfe4e1;border-radius:6px;height:34px;background:#fff;padding:0 24px 0 9px;color:#26352f}.bundle-toggle{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px}.bundle-toggle input{accent-color:#1c8061;width:16px;height:16px}.bundle-preview-actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:0 20px 18px;background:#fbfcfc;gap:8px}.bundle-hint{font-size:12px;color:#8a9198;line-height:1.6;margin:18px 0 0}.bundle-status-dot{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#25a87a;margin-right:6px}.bundle-type-note{background:#f0f6f3;border:1px solid #deebe4;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 16px;font-size:12px;color:#4c7263;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:17px}.bundle-empty{padding:50px 20px;text-align:center;background:white;border:1px dashed #dce4df;border-radius:12px;color:#7a8580}.bundle-count{font-size:12px;color:#91979d}.bundle-card-select{font-size:11px;color:#168260;background:#edf7f2;border-radius:5px;padding:4px 7px}.bundle-status-paused{color:#9c845c}.bundle-form-note{font-size:12px;color:#7d848a;line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px}.bundle-preview-shop.is-mobile{max-width:300px;margin:auto;border-left:1px solid #edf0ee;border-right:1px solid #edf0ee}.bundle-typing{color:#b77e22;font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:1050px){.bundle-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px}.bundle-product-thumb{width:54px;height:54px}.bundle-choice{padding:15px}}@media(max-width:820px){.bundle-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bundle-stats{gap:10px}.bundle-stat{padding:16px}.bundle-stat strong{font-size:23px}.bundle-title{align-items:start}}@media(max-width:520px){.bundle-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}.bundle-stat{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.bundle-stat-label{margin:0}.bundle-title{flex-direction:column}.bundle-choice-head{align-items:start}.bundle-preview-caption{display:none}}
</style>`;

function preview(ctx,bundle) {
  const sum=total(bundle), current=sum*(1-bundle.discount/100);
  return `<div class="bundle-preview-shop ${state(ctx).mobile?'is-mobile':''}"><small>NORTHLINE FITNESS</small><div class="bundle-preview-hero">${productImage(bundle.products[0])}</div><h3>${catalog[bundle.products[0]].name}</h3><div class="bundle-preview-price">${ctx.money(catalog[bundle.products[0]].price)}</div><div class="bundle-preview-rating"><span>★★★★★</span>4.9 · 128 条评价</div><div class="bundle-widget"><h4>一起购买，开启完整训练</h4><div class="bundle-widget-images">${bundle.products.map((id,i)=>`${i?'<span class="bundle-plus">+</span>':''}${productImage(id)}`).join('')}</div><div class="bundle-widget-total"><span>组合价</span><span><s>${ctx.money(sum)}</s><b>${ctx.money(current)}</b></span></div><button class="bundle-widget-button" data-bundle-preview-add>整组加入购物车 · 节省 ${bundle.discount}%</button></div></div>`;
}

export function renderBundles(ctx) {
  const local=state(ctx), list=items(ctx);
  let selected=list.find(x=>x.id===local.selected)||list[0];
  local.selected=selected.id;
  const shown=list.filter(x=>x.type===local.tab&&x.name.toLowerCase().includes(local.query.toLowerCase()));
  return `<section class="bundle-page">${styles}<div class="bundle-title"><div><h1>搭配销售</h1><p>把合适的商品放在一起，让每一次购买更有价值。</p></div><button class="button button-primary" data-create-bundle>${ctx.icon('plus',16)} 创建搭配组合</button></div><div class="bundle-stats"><div class="bundle-stat"><div class="bundle-stat-label">搭配带来的销售额</div><strong>${ctx.money(ctx.store==='eu'?14682:12486)}</strong><small>＋18.6%</small></div><div class="bundle-stat"><div class="bundle-stat-label">平均订单金额</div><strong>${ctx.money(ctx.store==='eu'?248.6:218.4)}</strong><small>＋12.4%</small></div><div class="bundle-stat"><div class="bundle-stat-label">搭配加购率</div><strong>16.8<span style="font-size:18px">%</span></strong><small>＋3.2%</small></div></div><div class="bundle-layout"><div><div class="tabs" aria-label="推荐类型"><button class="tab ${local.tab==='manual'?'active':''}" data-bundle-tab="manual">手动搭配 <span class="bundle-count">3</span></button><button class="tab ${local.tab==='auto'?'active':''}" data-bundle-tab="auto">自动共购</button><button class="tab ${local.tab==='global'?'active':''}" data-bundle-tab="global">全局推荐</button></div><div class="bundle-toolbar" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="bundle-search">${ctx.icon('search',16)}<input id="bundle-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索搭配组合" aria-label="搜索搭配组合" value="${escapeHTML(local.query)}"></div><span class="bundle-count">${shown.length} 个组合</span></div>${local.tab!=='manual'?`<div class="bundle-type-note">${ctx.icon('sparkles',15)} ${local.tab==='auto'?'根据历史订单中的共购关系推荐商品，自动过滤缺货与不可售商品。':'为所有商品展示统一的精选配件，适合推广店铺常青款。'}</div>`:''}<div class="bundle-list">${shown.length?shown.map(bundle=>`<button class="bundle-choice ${bundle.id===selected.id?'is-selected':''}" data-bundle-id="${bundle.id}" aria-pressed="${bundle.id===selected.id}"><div class="bundle-choice-head"><div><strong>${escapeHTML(bundle.name)}</strong><div class="bundle-choice-sub">${bundle.products.length} 件商品 · ${bundle.label}</div></div><span class="bundle-discount-pill">组合优惠 ${bundle.discount}%</span></div><div class="bundle-products">${bundle.products.map((id,i)=>`${i?'<span class="bundle-plus">+</span>':''}${productImage(id,'bundle-product-thumb')}`).join('')}<span style="margin-left:auto" class="${bundle.enabled?'bundle-card-select':'bundle-status-paused'}">${bundle.enabled?'已启用':'已暂停'}</span></div><div class="bundle-choice-foot"><span>${bundle.views.toLocaleString()} 次展示 · ${bundle.orders} 笔成交</span><b>${ctx.money(total(bundle)*(1-bundle.discount/100))}</b></div></button>`).join(''):'<div class="bundle-empty">没有找到匹配的组合，试试其他关键词。</div>'}</div><p class="bundle-hint">商品页优先展示手动搭配，库存与市场价格会在顾客加购时重新核验。</p></div><aside class="bundle-preview"><div class="bundle-preview-head"><span>商品页实时预览</span><button class="button button-small" data-toggle-bundle-device>${ctx.icon(local.mobile?'box':'eye',14)} ${local.mobile?'移动端':'桌面端'}</button></div><div data-bundle-live-preview>${preview(ctx,selected)}</div><div class="bundle-settings"><div class="bundle-setting-row"><label for="bundle-discount">组合优惠</label><select id="bundle-discount">${[10,15,20].map(n=>`<option value="${n}" ${selected.discount===n?'selected':''}>${n}% 折扣</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="bundle-setting-row"><span>展示此搭配组合</span><label class="bundle-toggle"><input id="bundle-enabled" type="checkbox" ${selected.enabled?'checked':''}>${selected.enabled?'已启用':'已暂停'}</label></div></div><div class="bundle-preview-actions"><button class="button button-small" data-bundle-open-store>${ctx.icon('eye',14)} 前台体验</button><button class="button button-primary button-small" data-bundle-save>保存设置</button></div></aside></div></section>`;
}

export function bindBundles(ctx) {
  const root=document.querySelector('.bundle-page');if(!root)return;
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-bundle-tab]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{const local=state(ctx);local.tab=el.dataset.bundleTab;local.query='';const first=items(ctx).find(x=>x.type===local.tab);if(first)local.selected=first.id;redraw(ctx);}));
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-bundle-id]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{state(ctx).selected=el.dataset.bundleId;redraw(ctx);}));
  root.querySelector('#bundle-search')?.addEventListener('input',event=>{const pos=event.target.selectionStart;state(ctx).query=event.target.value;redraw(ctx);const input=document.querySelector('#bundle-search');input?.focus();try{input?.setSelectionRange(pos,pos)}catch{}});
  root.querySelector('[data-create-bundle]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>ctx.openModal('创建搭配组合',`<form id="modal-form"><div class="field"><label for="new-bundle-name">组合名称</label><input class="input" name="name" id="new-bundle-name" placeholder="例如：家庭训练入门套装" required maxlength="40"></div><div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="field"><label for="new-bundle-product">主商品</label><select class="select" id="new-bundle-product" name="product">${Object.entries(catalog).map(([id,x])=>`<option value="${id}">${x.name}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="new-bundle-discount">组合优惠</label><select class="select" id="new-bundle-discount" name="discount"><option value="10">10% 折扣</option><option value="15">15% 折扣</option><option value="20">20% 折扣</option></select></div></div><div class="field" style="margin-top:18px"><label for="new-bundle-related">搭配商品</label><select class="select" id="new-bundle-related" name="related"><option value="bench">可调节力量训练凳</option><option value="plates">奥林匹克杠铃片套装</option><option value="mat">高密度健身地垫</option></select></div><p class="bundle-form-note">新组合将保存到当前店铺的演示数据中，可在右侧预览后调整展示设置。</p></form>`,form=>{const data=new FormData(form),name=String(data.get('name')||'').trim();if(!name){ctx.toast('请输入组合名称');return false;}const products=[...new Set([data.get('product'),data.get('related')])];if(products.length<2){ctx.toast('请选择两件不同的商品');return false;}const id=`manual-${Date.now()}`;save(ctx,[{id,name,label:'新组合',products,discount:Number(data.get('discount')),enabled:true,type:'manual',views:0,orders:0},...items(ctx)]);Object.assign(state(ctx),{selected:id,tab:'manual',query:''});redraw(ctx);ctx.toast('搭配组合已创建');return true;}));
  root.querySelector('#bundle-discount')?.addEventListener('change',event=>{const list=items(ctx),bundle=list.find(x=>x.id===state(ctx).selected);bundle.discount=Number(event.target.value);save(ctx,list);state(ctx).dirty=true;root.querySelector('[data-bundle-live-preview]').innerHTML=preview(ctx,bundle);root.querySelector('[data-bundle-save]').textContent='保存更改';bindPreviewAdd(ctx,root);});
  root.querySelector('#bundle-enabled')?.addEventListener('change',event=>{const list=items(ctx),bundle=list.find(x=>x.id===state(ctx).selected);bundle.enabled=event.target.checked;save(ctx,list);state(ctx).dirty=true;const label=event.target.parentElement;label.lastChild.textContent=bundle.enabled?'已启用':'已暂停';root.querySelector('[data-bundle-save]').textContent='保存更改';});
  root.querySelector('[data-bundle-save]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{state(ctx).dirty=false;selectStorefrontBundle(ctx,state(ctx).selected);redraw(ctx);ctx.toast('搭配设置已保存到当前店铺');});
  root.querySelector('[data-toggle-bundle-device]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{state(ctx).mobile=!state(ctx).mobile;redraw(ctx);} );
  root.querySelector('[data-bundle-open-store]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{selectStorefrontBundle(ctx,state(ctx).selected);ctx.navigate('storefront');});
  bindPreviewAdd(ctx,root);
}
function bindPreviewAdd(ctx,root){root.querySelector('[data-bundle-preview-add]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const b=items(ctx).find(x=>x.id===state(ctx).selected);selectStorefrontBundle(ctx,b.id);ctx.persist(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,b.products);ctx.toast(`已将 ${b.products.length} 件商品加入演示购物车`);});}

const storefrontUI = new Map();
function customerState(ctx){const bundle=storefrontConfig(ctx);if(!storefrontUI.has(ctx.store))storefrontUI.set(ctx.store,{mode:'available',selected:[...bundle.products],bundleId:bundle.id,cartOpen:false,mobile:false,variant:'黑色 · 标准版'});const local=storefrontUI.get(ctx.store);if(local.bundleId!==bundle.id){local.bundleId=bundle.id;local.selected=[...bundle.products];}return local;}
const storefrontStyles = `<style>
.storefront-page{--sf-green:#213d31}.storefront-toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.storefront-shell{background:white;border:1px solid #e2e6e9;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}.storefront-shell.is-mobile{max-width:440px;margin:auto}.storefront-announcement{background:#223e32;color:#fff;font-size:10px;text-align:center;padding:9px;letter-spacing:1px}.storefront-nav{padding:23px 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0ed}.storefront-brand{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:3px;font-weight:750;color:#243b30}.storefront-links{display:flex;gap:26px;font-size:12px;color:#68736d}.storefront-cart-button{border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;position:relative;padding:4px;color:#253f33}.storefront-cart-count{position:absolute;right:-6px;top:-5px;background:#223e32;color:white;border-radius:50%;width:17px;height:17px;font-size:9px;display:grid;place-items:center}.storefront-inner{padding:26px 32px 32px}.storefront-breadcrumb{font-size:11px;color:#98a09b;margin-bottom:23px}.storefront-product{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(310px,.9fr);gap:44px}.storefront-main-image{height:460px;background:#f4f5f2;border-radius:4px;display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative}.storefront-main-image img{height:400px;width:90%;object-fit:contain}.storefront-image-label{position:absolute;left:18px;top:18px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#385c44;border:1px solid #cfdbce;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:3px}.storefront-thumbs{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.storefront-thumb{border:1px solid #e0e5e0;background:#f8f9f7;border-radius:4px;width:67px;height:67px;padding:5px;cursor:pointer}.storefront-thumb.active{border-color:#506c56}.storefront-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.storefront-eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#78887d;margin:4px 0 12px}.storefront-product h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.5px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px;color:#23352a}.storefront-rating{color:#748079;font-size:10px}.storefront-rating span{color:#a47e42;letter-spacing:2px;margin-right:10px}.storefront-price{font-size:28px;margin:22px 0 7px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-1px}.storefront-tax{font-size:10px;color:#98a09b}.storefront-description{font-size:12px;color:#7a847e;line-height:1.9;margin:20px 0}.storefront-variant-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px;color:#6e7a71;margin-bottom:10px}.storefront-variant{border:1px solid #e1e6e1;background:#fff;padding:11px 13px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;color:#304737;width:100%;text-align:left;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.storefront-instock{font-size:10px;color:#567e5d;margin:13px 0 19px}.storefront-main-cta{display:block;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:4px;background:#223e32;color:white;padding:14px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.storefront-shipping-note{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:16px;font-size:10px;color:#8c968e}.storefront-bundle{margin-top:25px;border:1px solid #dae3db;border-radius:7px;padding:17px}.storefront-bundle-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#304d39}.storefront-bundle-save{background:#eaf1e9;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 6px;font-size:9px;font-weight:400}.storefront-bundle-list{margin-top:15px;display:grid;gap:11px}.storefront-bundle-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}.storefront-bundle-item input{accent-color:#315a3d;width:14px;height:14px}.storefront-bundle-item img{width:39px;height:39px;object-fit:contain;background:#f4f6f2;border-radius:4px}.storefront-bundle-item b{font-size:10px;font-weight:400;margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}.storefront-bundle-total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #e9eee8;margin-top:14px;padding-top:13px;font-size:11px}.storefront-bundle-total s{font-size:10px;color:#9da79f;margin-right:6px}.storefront-bundle-add{background:#223e32;color:white;border:0;border-radius:4px;padding:11px;width:100%;font-size:11px;margin-top:12px;cursor:pointer}.storefront-bundle-add:disabled{background:#a1ada4;cursor:not-allowed}.storefront-reassurance{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid #ecefeb;margin-top:32px;padding-top:21px;color:#526556;font-size:11px;text-align:center}.storefront-reassurance div{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px}.storefront-prototype-note{color:#959da4;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin:15px 0 0}.storefront-cart-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#1b2e2540;z-index:20;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end}.storefront-cart-drawer{width:380px;max-width:100%;background:#fff;box-shadow:-10px 0 40px #18332720;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.storefront-cart-head{padding:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #e9eeea}.storefront-cart-head h3{font-size:17px;margin:0}.storefront-close{border:0;background:#f3f6f2;border-radius:50%;width:29px;height:29px;cursor:pointer;color:#516154;font-size:18px}.storefront-cart-items{padding:10px 24px;flex:1}.storefront-cart-item{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf0ed;align-items:center;font-size:12px}.storefront-cart-item img{width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:contain;background:#f3f5f0;border-radius:5px}.storefront-cart-item small{display:block;color:#98a39a;margin-top:7px}.storefront-cart-remove{border:0;background:none;color:#8c978f;cursor:pointer;margin-left:auto;font-size:11px}.storefront-cart-footer{padding:24px;background:#fafbf8;border-top:1px solid #e6ece5}.storefront-cart-sum{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:15px}.storefront-cart-empty{font-size:13px;color:#9aa59d;padding:35px 0;text-align:center}.storefront-subscribe{margin-top:24px;padding:20px;background:#f4f7f2;border:1px solid #e0e8dc;border-radius:6px}.storefront-subscribe h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 9px;color:#38563d}.storefront-subscribe p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:#83907f;margin:0 0 14px}.storefront-subscribe input[type=email]{width:100%;border:1px solid #d8e1d4;border-radius:4px;background:white;padding:12px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px}.storefront-subscribe-check{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:10px;color:#899383;line-height:1.7;margin-top:12px}.storefront-subscribe-check input{accent-color:#315a3d}.storefront-subscribe-success{padding:20px 0;text-align:center;color:#467550;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9}.storefront-mode-button{border:1px solid #dfe5e1;background:white;font-size:11px;color:#5a7063;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}.storefront-mode-button.active{border-color:#457254;background:#f1f6f0}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-product{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-links{display:none}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-inner{padding:20px}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-nav{padding:20px}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-main-image{height:310px}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-main-image img{height:270px}.storefront-shell.is-mobile .storefront-reassurance{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
@media(max-width:1100px){.storefront-product{gap:25px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.storefront-main-image{height:390px}.storefront-main-image img{height:340px}.storefront-inner{padding:24px}.storefront-product h2{font-size:23px}}@media(max-width:800px){.storefront-product{grid-template-columns:1fr}.storefront-links{display:none}.storefront-title{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.storefront-toolbar{flex-wrap:wrap}.storefront-main-image{height:360px}.storefront-main-image img{height:320px}}@media(max-width:500px){.storefront-inner{padding:18px}.storefront-nav{padding:20px}.storefront-reassurance{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.storefront-announcement{font-size:9px}}
</style>`;

function storefrontBundle(ctx) {
  const local=customerState(ctx),selected=local.selected,summary=offerSummary(ctx,selected),bundle=summary.bundle;
  return `<div class="storefront-bundle-head"><span>${escapeHTML(bundle.name)}</span><span class="storefront-bundle-save">${bundle.enabled?`整组购买省 ${bundle.discount}%`:'此组合已暂停'}</span></div><div class="storefront-bundle-list">${bundle.products.map(id=>`<label class="storefront-bundle-item"><input type="checkbox" data-sf-product="${id}" ${selected.includes(id)?'checked':''}>${productImage(id)}<span>${catalog[id].short}</span><b>${ctx.money(catalog[id].price)}</b></label>`).join('')}</div><div class="storefront-bundle-total"><span>${summary.eligible?'组合总计':`选齐 ${bundle.products.length} 件享组合价`}</span><span>${summary.discount?`<s>${ctx.money(summary.original)}</s>`:''}<strong>${ctx.money(summary.total)}</strong></span></div><button class="storefront-bundle-add" data-sf-add-bundle ${!selected.length?'disabled':''}>${selected.length?`将 ${selected.length} 件商品加入购物车`:'请至少选择一件商品'}</button>`;
}
function cartView(ctx) {
  const ids=ctx.read(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,[]),summary=offerSummary(ctx,ids);
  return `<div class="storefront-cart-overlay" data-sf-cart-backdrop><aside class="storefront-cart-drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="演示购物车"><div class="storefront-cart-head"><h3>你的购物车 <span style="color:#8d9c90;font-size:13px">(${ids.length})</span></h3><button class="storefront-close" data-sf-close-cart aria-label="关闭购物车">×</button></div><div class="storefront-cart-items">${ids.length?ids.map((id,i)=>`<div class="storefront-cart-item">${productImage(id)}<div>${catalog[id].short}<small>${ctx.money(catalog[id].price)} · 数量 1</small></div><button class="storefront-cart-remove" data-sf-remove="${i}">移除</button></div>`).join(''):'<div class="storefront-cart-empty">购物车还是空的，挑选你的训练装备吧。</div>'}</div><div class="storefront-cart-footer">${summary.discount?`<div style="font-size:11px;color:#66836a;margin-bottom:12px">已应用 ${summary.bundle.discount}% 搭配优惠 · 节省 ${ctx.money(summary.discount)}</div>`:''}<div class="storefront-cart-sum"><span>小计</span><strong>${ctx.money(summary.total)}</strong></div><button class="storefront-main-cta" data-sf-checkout>继续结账</button><p style="font-size:10px;color:#95a090;text-align:center;margin:12px 0 0">运费与税费将在结账时计算</p></div></aside></div>`;
}
export function renderStorefront(ctx) {
  const local=customerState(ctx),out=local.mode==='out',cart=ctx.read(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,[]),mainProduct=storefrontConfig(ctx).products[0],product=out?catalog.bench:catalog[mainProduct];
  return `<section class="storefront-page">${storefrontStyles}<div class="storefront-title"><div><h1>店铺前台预览</h1><p>体验顾客眼中的搭配购买与补货提醒。</p></div><div class="storefront-toolbar"><button class="storefront-mode-button ${!out?'active':''}" data-sf-mode="available">搭配购买</button><button class="storefront-mode-button ${out?'active':''}" data-sf-mode="out">缺货订阅</button><button class="button button-small" data-sf-device>${ctx.icon('eye',14)} ${local.mobile?'移动端':'桌面端'}</button></div></div><div class="storefront-shell ${local.mobile?'is-mobile':''}"><div class="storefront-announcement">为你的每一次进步而设计 · ${ctx.store==='eu'?'欧洲地区本地配送':`英国本土满 ${ctx.money(1200)} 享免运费`}</div><div class="storefront-nav"><div class="storefront-brand">NORTHLINE<span style="font-size:8px;display:block;letter-spacing:5.3px;margin-top:4px">FITNESS AT HOME</span></div><nav class="storefront-links"><span>力量训练</span><span>配件装备</span><span>打造家庭健身房</span></nav><button class="storefront-cart-button" data-sf-open-cart aria-label="打开购物车">${ctx.icon('cart',20)}${cart.length?`<span class="storefront-cart-count">${cart.length}</span>`:''}</button></div><div class="storefront-inner"><div class="storefront-breadcrumb">首页 / 力量训练 / ${product.name}</div><div class="storefront-product"><div><div class="storefront-main-image"><span class="storefront-image-label">${out?'即将补货':'HOME GYM ESSENTIAL'}</span>${productImage(out?'bench':mainProduct)}</div><div class="storefront-thumbs">${(out?['bench','mat','plates']:[...new Set([mainProduct,...Object.keys(catalog)])]).map((id,i)=>`<button class="storefront-thumb ${!i?'active':''}" data-sf-thumb="${id}" aria-label="查看${catalog[id].name}">${productImage(id)}</button>`).join('')}</div></div><div><div class="storefront-eyebrow">BUILT FOR YOUR EVERYDAY PROGRESS</div><h2>${out?'可调节力量训练凳 · 沙色':product.name}</h2><div class="storefront-rating"><span>★★★★★</span>4.9 / 5 · 128 条评价（演示）</div><div class="storefront-price">${ctx.money(product.price)}</div><div class="storefront-tax">含增值税 · ${ctx.store==='eu'?'欧盟地区配送':'英国本土配送'}</div><p class="storefront-description">${out?'从平板到上斜，每一个角度都为稳定发力而设计。让家庭力量训练拥有更扎实的支撑。':'将专业训练带回家。深蹲、推举与全身力量训练，一套装备，承载每一天的进步。'}</p><div class="storefront-variant-label"><span>规格</span><span>${out?'沙色 · 标准版':'黑色 · 标准版'}</span></div><button class="storefront-variant" data-sf-variant>${out?'沙色 · 标准版':'黑色 · 标准版'} ${ctx.icon('chevronDown',13)}</button><div class="storefront-instock">${out?'<span style="color:#a47e42">暂时缺货 · 可订阅到货提醒</span>':'● 现货供应 · 通常 2–4 个工作日送达'}</div>${out?`<form class="storefront-subscribe" id="sf-subscribe"><h3>补货时，第一时间通知你</h3><p>留下邮箱，我们会在此款商品恢复库存时发送通知。</p><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="输入你的邮箱地址" aria-label="到货提醒邮箱" required><button class="storefront-main-cta" type="submit">通知我到货</button><label class="storefront-subscribe-check"><input type="checkbox" name="marketing"><span>同时订阅新品与训练灵感邮件（可选）</span></label></form>`:`<button class="storefront-main-cta" data-sf-add-main>加入购物车</button><div class="storefront-shipping-note"><span>安全支付</span><span>30 天退换</span><span>专业售后支持</span></div><div class="storefront-bundle" data-sf-bundle>${storefrontBundle(ctx)}</div>`}</div></div><div class="storefront-reassurance"><div>${ctx.icon('check',16)} 为家庭训练而设计</div><div>${ctx.icon('box',16)} 可靠包装与配送</div><div>${ctx.icon('globe',16)} 本地团队为你服务</div></div></div>${local.cartOpen?cartView(ctx):''}</div><p class="storefront-prototype-note">前台交互原型 · 商品、价格与库存均为演示数据。可切换“缺货订阅”体验补货通知流程。</p></section>`;
}
function redrawStorefront(ctx){const root=document.querySelector('.storefront-page');if(root){root.outerHTML=renderStorefront(ctx);bindStorefront(ctx);}}
function openCart(ctx,ids){if(ids)ctx.persist(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,ids);customerState(ctx).cartOpen=true;redrawStorefront(ctx);document.querySelector('[data-sf-close-cart]')?.focus();}
export function bindStorefront(ctx) {
  const root=document.querySelector('.storefront-page');if(!root)return;
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-mode]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{customerState(ctx).mode=el.dataset.sfMode;customerState(ctx).cartOpen=false;redrawStorefront(ctx);}));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-device]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{customerState(ctx).mobile=!customerState(ctx).mobile;redrawStorefront(ctx);} );
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-thumb]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{const image=root.querySelector('.storefront-main-image img');image.src=`./assets/${catalog[el.dataset.sfThumb].image}`;image.alt=catalog[el.dataset.sfThumb].name;root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-thumb]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===el));}));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-variant]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>ctx.toast('当前演示款式为标准版，正式接入后将读取 Shopify 变体。'));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-open-cart]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>openCart(ctx));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-add-main]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>openCart(ctx,[...ctx.read(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,[]),storefrontConfig(ctx).products[0]]));
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-product]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('change',()=>{customerState(ctx).selected=[...root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-product]:checked')].map(x=>x.dataset.sfProduct);root.querySelector('[data-sf-bundle]').innerHTML=storefrontBundle(ctx);bindStorefrontBundle(ctx,root);}));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-add-bundle]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>openCart(ctx,[...customerState(ctx).selected]));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-close-cart]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{customerState(ctx).cartOpen=false;redrawStorefront(ctx);} );
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-cart-backdrop]')?.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target.hasAttribute('data-sf-cart-backdrop')){customerState(ctx).cartOpen=false;redrawStorefront(ctx);}});
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-remove]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>{const ids=ctx.read(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,[]);ids.splice(Number(el.dataset.sfRemove),1);ctx.persist(`demo-cart-${ctx.store}`,ids);redrawStorefront(ctx);}));
  root.querySelector('[data-sf-checkout]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>ctx.toast('已完成演示购买流程；真实结账将在 Shopify 接入后启用。'));
  root.querySelector('#sf-subscribe')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget;if(!form.reportValidity())return;const data=new FormData(form),saved=ctx.read(`demo-restock-${ctx.store}`,[]);saved.push({email:data.get('email'),product:'bench',marketing:data.get('marketing')==='on',createdAt:new Date().toISOString()});ctx.persist(`demo-restock-${ctx.store}`,saved);form.innerHTML=`<div class="storefront-subscribe-success">${ctx.icon('check',27)}<br><strong>已成功订阅到货提醒</strong><br>商品补货后，我们会通知 ${escapeHTML(data.get('email'))}。</div>`;ctx.toast('到货提醒订阅成功');});
  root.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(event.key==='Escape'&&customerState(ctx).cartOpen){customerState(ctx).cartOpen=false;redrawStorefront(ctx);}});
}
function bindStorefrontBundle(ctx,root){root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-product]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('change',()=>{customerState(ctx).selected=[...root.querySelectorAll('[data-sf-product]:checked')].map(x=>x.dataset.sfProduct);root.querySelector('[data-sf-bundle]').innerHTML=storefrontBundle(ctx);bindStorefrontBundle(ctx,root);}));root.querySelector('[data-sf-add-bundle]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>openCart(ctx,[...customerState(ctx).selected]));}
